  "limits": "Pores and aggregate come from Voronoi cells, which are evenly spread rather than graded like real aggregate. Board seams are horizontal only (along object Z) and carry no wood grain imprint. No cracks or spalling. Rendered here with Cycles CPU only. Verified in Blender 5.2.1; written for the 4.2 API.",
